  "description": "The core of the OASIS (Open API System / Omniverse Interoperability System) -- the GOD Protocol and API powering the decentralised Web4-Web10 Omniverse. Contains the OASIS Engine, HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture, Avatar API, Karma API, Holon/Data API, Keys/Wallets API, SEEDS API, and all core interfaces, managers, object models, and enums. Supports 55+ blockchain and decentralised network providers with Auto-FailOver, Auto-LoadBalancing, Auto-Replication, Auto-Sync, Write-Once-Deploy-Everywhere, Offline Support, and Triple-Level Quantum-Resistant Encryption. Explore the full OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://oasisomniverse.one -- Source code: https://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS -- REST API: https://api.web4.oasisomniverse.one",
