  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Core v2.0.6\n\nThe core of the OASIS (Open API System / Omniverse Interoperability System) -- the GOD Protocol and API powering the decentralised Web4-Web10 Omniverse. Contains the OASIS Engine, HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture, Avatar API, Karma API, Holon/Data API, Keys/Wallets API, SEEDS API, and all core interfaces, managers, object models, and enums. Supports 55+ blockchain and decentralised network providers with Auto-FailOver, Auto-LoadBalancing, Auto-Replication, Auto-Sync, Write-Once-Deploy-Everywhere, Offline Support, and Triple-Level Quantum-Resistant Encryption. Explore the full OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://oasisomniverse.one -- Source code: https://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS -- REST API: https://api.web4.oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.5\n- Add anonymous Azure Blob CQL properties and verify Mongo demo (eaba320)\n- Add authenticated priced stored-intent recovery boundary with explicit host grants (eeedf02)\n- Add Bitcoin API query admission and verified Mongo federation demo (b185b6a)\n- Add bounded Self Protocol registry CQL to sandbox candidate (35707d1)\n- Add bounded SubQuery dictionary CQL to isolated sandbox candidate (f47a8ed)\n- Add Chainflip query-only HTTP demo and verify original Mongo fixture (5c57fd8)\n- Add current Civic public network CQL to scoped sandbox candidate (ef62c32)\n- Add current Holonym attestation CQL to scoped sandbox candidate (48051e8)\n- Add durable SQLite preparation claims with shared ownership contract (481432b)\n- Add fail-closed native settlement route and compiled controller HTTP tests (05b3987)\n- Add five qualified public cross-chain CQL readers to accepted NATS sandbox release (4b4f467)\n- Add free-source Worldscape catalogue, visit history and server-owned visit rewards (bf726bc)\n- Add full MapLibre style-document CQL to scoped sandbox candidate (58f65d3)\n- Add native Mastodon status-point CQL and verified developer walkthrough (9fbde0e)\n- Add native MongoDB CQL and shared annotated scalar query paths (bf76a00)\n- Add qualified owned NATS TLS source to accepted DuckDB sandbox release (9a26ed5)\n- Add retained read-only DuckDB hosting to the accepted Waku release (ec4e68d)\n- Add retained Waku Store runtime to accepted Graph and PouchDB sandbox sources (910c25b)\n- Add scoped Dapr reader and native package to accepted demo release (19b902b)\n- Add server-authoritative OLAND checkout and recover historical Karma audits (613c56e)\n- Add six qualified public CQL readers to accepted sandbox release (3dc9599)\n- Add Solana SPL token creation via the token-issuer capability (7e20c87)\n- Add Stellar API read admission and verified Mongo federation demo (ef76229)\n- Add tested Aptos API admission and local Mongo federation (f3025d0)\n- Add tested TON read admission and preserve pre-persistence native gate (4df10c9)\n- Add verified Berachain CQL read profile and refresh hosted demo guides (694baaa)\n- Add WEB4 delegated usage grants for unattended, budget-capped reservations (39cea61)\n- Add WEB4 sandbox controller: demo sessions and provider offline switch (9692894)\n- Add XRPL API read admission and verified Mongo federation demo (07a32d1)\n- Admit bounded protocol federation with captured route budget and visibility fences (2a71286)\n- Admit Hedera paid queries under aggregate signed fee budgets (54ce56a)\n- Advance API Core to the RecordNotFound fix; add legacy allowMissing regression test (6cd50d1)\n- Advance Core and WEB6 to delegated execution and scheduled agent runs (6495443)\n- Advance Core recovery integrity fix with verified deployment pin (0b51204)\n- Advance the live indexed demo through acknowledged continuous ingestion (9f62051)\n- Apply exact committed tombstones across Ethereum and SQLite replicas (4fd754d)\n- Apply one exact CQL route registry to tariff and hosted admission (69c42c4)\n- Bind Oracle CQL authorization and discovery to provider-scoped host catalogues (5c5f913)\n- Bind sharing reads and writes to one authority and caller snapshot (ee4c21f)\n- Bind SQLite indexed queries to shared source evidence contract (230de45)\n- Carry four-provider candidate onto the verified WEB4 recovery base (9898ea3)\n- Centralize fail-closed sharing recipient validation in Core (25d4a6b)\n- Certify ordered grouped buffers with exact ties and nonadjacent identity checks (99d5695)\n- chore(submodule): Core to Development 21778fc (HyperDrive replica read fallback) (e56edf2)\n- chore(submodule): Core with save failure reasons (845d253)\n- chore(submodule): Core with wizard save revision binding (b1cf190)\n- Classify identity ambiguity and prevent cross-provider fallback (14e6f14)\n- Classify Neo4j SDK-owned transport timeout without weakening caller cancellation (0853a29)\n- Complete subscription pricing and payment activation contracts (1acf016)\n- Connect SQLite CQL to shared native execution with preflight and provenance (ca729c8)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/OASIS Architecture/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Core",
